## MikroMCP and Node.js runtime dependencies

**MikroMCP v1.10.0** is included as a pinned git submodule/runtime overlay and is MIT-licensed:
https://github.com/AliKarami/MikroMCP

Its production dependency graph is locked by `external/mikromcp/package-lock.json`. The direct
runtime packages include:

- `@inquirer/prompts` — MIT;
- `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk` — MIT;
- `basic-ftp` — MIT;
- `bcryptjs` — BSD-3-Clause;
- `chalk` — MIT;
- `commander` — MIT;
