## Release rule

Do not publish a bundle unless `manifest.sha256`, the exact lockfiles, and all license files are
generated from the same source commit. The public bundle does not include the copyrighted RouterOS
manual corpus; an operator may copy a separately obtained local RAG pack into `.mth/rag`.
